-- Sixteen formulas the runtime evaluates could never be saved.
--
-- sonara_formula_results.formula_key references sonara_formula_definitions, and
-- these keys were added to lib/sonara-formula-library.cjs without a row here, so
-- every save of one was refused by the foreign key -- and the route reported
-- that refusal as "setup_required", which told the owner to finish a setup that
-- was already finished. 20261004130000 seeded twelve the same way; these were
-- missed then. tests/every-formula-can-be-saved.test.js now fails when a formula
-- is added to the library without a row in a migration.
--
-- No new tables, grants or customer records. Existing definitions are preserved.
ON CONFLICT (formula_key) DO NOTHING;
